stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> WaitingForTheCustomerToConfirmTheOrder : customer places a new order
    state "Waiting for the customer to confirm the order and pay the invoice" as Wait
    Idle --> Wait
    Wait --> Processing : paid
    state check <<choice>>
    Processing --> check
    check --> Shipped : stock available in the main warehouse
    check --> Backordered : out of stock
    Backordered --> Processing
    Shipped --> [*]
    note right of Wait
        The customer has fourteen days to pay before the order expires
    end note
